04/18", weight="83", tooltip="NEIRA Boys & Girls Fours,LOLHS VS EO Smith			
Distance: 1500 Conditions: 5-8 MPH crossing tailwind, Calming down through the course. Comments: B3v4 Started approx 3 lenghts down from the starting bouy. G1v4 E.O. Smith Crabbed after the start, race progressed as EO Smith recovered and continued the race. 
It was a good Saturday morning out on the lake for a quick race between LOL and EO Smith. The wind at the start was tricky for lining up but after the B3V4 lining up was easier. We would like to thank EO Smith for making the trip to start our weekend. We hope to see you at NEIRAs
